---
// What happens next timeline rail
---
<!-- =====================================================================
     WHAT HAPPENS NEXT
     ===================================================================== -->
<section id="next" class="shell band scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-[clamp(28px,3vw,48px)]">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <p class="kicker reveal">What happens next</p>
      <h2 class="display d-md reveal" style="--d:80ms">
        From here to the corridor.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <ol class="grid gap-x-6 gap-y-9 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <li class="rail-step is-now reveal">
        <p class="text-[10.5px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-coral">Now</p>
        <h3 class="heading text-[clamp(18px,1.7vw,23px)] mt-2.5">Interest registered</h3>
        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-body mt-2">We confirm receipt and propose a short call.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="rail-step reveal" style="--d:90ms">
        <p class="kicker">2026</p>
        <h3 class="heading text-[clamp(18px,1.7vw,23px)] mt-2.5">Operations begin</h3>
        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-body mt-2">First training cohorts and pilot engagements start in Accra.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="rail-step reveal" style="--d:180ms">
        <p class="kicker">November 2026</p>
        <h3 class="heading text-[clamp(18px,1.7vw,23px)] mt-2.5">Launch at GABS, Accra</h3>
        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-body mt-2">The Hub is formally launched with its founding partners.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="rail-step reveal" style="--d:270ms">
        <p class="kicker">From 2027</p>
        <h3 class="heading text-[clamp(18px,1.7vw,23px)] mt-2.5">Corridor at scale</h3>
        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-body mt-2">Placement, incubation and delivery running across both regions.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
